<form class="totalform help-on-hover help-box" data-method="POST" data-api="/api" data-route="/admin/settings/activity"><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: enable;"><label for="field-UID">Record Activity</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="enable" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="help-UID" checked/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Record Activity</label></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Master switch. When off, nothing new is recorded. Existing rows stay and can still be browsed until they age out.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: retentionDays;"><label for="field-UID">Keep Activity (days)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="retentionDays" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="90" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="90" min="1" max="3650" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Rows older than this are deleted, checked once a day. Raise it when you need a longer audit trail; the store grows by roughly a few hundred bytes per row.</p></div><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: mcpAnonymous;"><label for="field-UID">Record Anonymous MCP Calls</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="mcpAnonymous" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="help-UID"/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Record Anonymous MCP Calls</label></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Tool calls from AI clients that are not signed in. Off by default: a public MCP server listed in an AI directory can take thousands of anonymous lookups a day. Signed-in callers and API keys are always recorded.</p></div><div class="form-inline-fields"><button type="submit" class="button btn cms-save cms-button">Save Settings</button></div></form>